 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2174  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2174) 'An audit found 32 pairs of (open RFD, abandoned RFD it cites). The class of concern is open RFDs that lean on an abandoned RFD's decision as if it still holds, without knowing the citation went stale.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2174  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2174) 'Look up your RFD below and migrate any citation of an abandoned RFD to the successor named there.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2174  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2174) 'Index of open RFDs citing abandoned RFDs
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2174  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2174) 'Full pair list from the 2026-09-02 audit. Format: citing RFD (state) → cited abandoned RFD → successor to migrate to, or note.
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD2174  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2174) 'This RFD is the citable index for open-to-abandoned citation drift; the 32 pairs sit in DETAILS.md, and individual RFDs migrate their citations when next touched.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2174  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2174) 'Details
 # tags: rfd:section-heading
 Text:RFD2174  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2174) 'Each pair in DETAILS.md is annotated with what the citing RFD's claim depends on and where the successor lives. Cheaper than 32 amendments; provides one URN to cite when a reader hits a stale reference and needs the successor without a rewrite pass. Pattern established by RFD66606-2173 (Qwen3-VL swap index).
 # tags: rfd:section
 Text:RFD2174  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2174) 'Spine: urn:oid:1.3.6.1.4.1.66606.1.1.1000 (RFD conventions). Applies to: 30-plus open RFDs; see DETAILS.md for the full list.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2174  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2174) 'Concentrations
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2174  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2174) 'Concentrations: RFD66606-1122 (wholebody detector, abandoned by 2168) cited by 11 open RFDs; RFD66606-1166 (See-Through scoring plan) cited by 7; RFD66606-1049-1052 (abandoned model images) cited by 1133 and 1171; RFD66606-1019 (strangler-fig studio core, abandoned by 2169) cited by 4.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2174  1 LINE
 Text:Written

