2026-09-02T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2174) 'RFD66606-1122's bespoke wholebody detector never shipped; RFD66606-1143 (published) and 1173 (discussion) settled the pipeline differently. Every citation below treats 1122's rendered-ANNY corpus route as authoritative when the workspace actually uses ANNY-as-pose-primitive per RFD66606-1143.
 # tags: rfd:details
