2026-09-02T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2174) 'Not all are drift: a retraction chain legitimately cites what it walks back, and RFD66606-2168 (wholebody detector retraction) and 2169 (studio-core abandonment) do exactly this.
 # tags: rfd:details
